ntfy-description =
    Ntfy is a simple, self-hosted HTTP-based push notification service.

    It enables FreeSynergy to send real-time alerts and notifications to any device — phones, tablets,
    desktops, and scripts. Supports UnifiedPush for FOSS Android apps (replacing Google FCM),
    direct HTTP PUT/POST, and WebSocket delivery.

ntfy-features =
    - HTTP and WebSocket push notification delivery
    - UnifiedPush compatible (FOSS alternative to Google FCM)
    - Topic-based publish/subscribe
    - Persistent message cache (SQLite)
    - Access control (user accounts or token-based)
    - No app install required — works from any HTTP client or curl
    - Official apps for Android and iOS
    - Supports webhooks, scheduled messages, and priorities
